.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-08-08T18:27:52Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T16:55:09Z","closed_at":"2025-08-12T16:55:09Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible: v4.5.beta.custom_build [80a219a58]\n- Not reproducible: v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n- Edit: introduced in b98da2bd58a7e467821ef392704f99ff8aabdd9b\n\n### System information\n\n`Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sat, 18 Jan 2025 02:26:57 +0000 on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6800 XT - AMD Ryzen 9 5900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 15.53 GiB memory`\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn previous Godot versions you could rotate an object by holding down control/command when dragging it. This seems to be interrupted now by the \"move with snapping\" logic. The editor will start to rotate the object, however once you move the mouse it will now switch to translating instead of rotating.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a mesh instance and assign a basic mesh (for example a CubeMesh)\n2. Make sure the editor viewport is in select tool mode\n3. Hold down control/command, then move try to rotate the object by dragging it at a mouse position **outside** of any gizmo handles but on the object itself.\n\nIf you are careful not to move the mouse at the drag start, you can actually see the editor display the \"Rotating\" text in the bottom left of the viewport. Once you move your mouse to perform the drag, it will switch to \"Translating\".\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nreproducible without a project","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109440/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}